\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.1}{\ignorespaces Overview of the pipeline. A single set of backscaled initial conditions (Sec.~\ref {sec:ic_generation}) is evolved by both solvers; the shell builder (Sec.~\ref {sec:shell_builder}) makes Disco-DJ emit its lightcone on exactly CosmoGridV1's radial shell grid, yielding paired low/high maps that differ only through the force solvers. Three correction pipelines (Sec.~\ref {sec:correction-pipelines}) then map the low-fidelity lightcone toward the reference, and all are scored with the same evaluation statistics.}}{14}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline_overview}{{2.1}{14}{}{figure.2.1}{}}
