\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.7}{\ignorespaces The harmonic apply chain (\texttt  {ml/transfer/apply\_transfer.py}). The correction is applied as a band-limited \emph  {residual} $(T-1)\,a_{\ell m}$ on top of the native full-resolution map: reconstructing purely through \texttt  {alm2map} would band-limit the output to $\ell \le \ell _{\max }$ and discard genuine structure the $N_{\mathrm  {side}}{=}2048$ map holds beyond it (up to $\ell \sim 3N_{\mathrm  {side}}{-}1$).}}{22}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:transfer_flow}{{2.7}{22}{}{figure.2.7}{}}
