\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces The 30 held-out validation cosmologies and their varied parameters (from each run's \texttt  {params.yml}; all other parameters are fixed across the CosmoGridV1 grid, Sec.~\ref {sec:cosmogrid}). Cosmologies marked $^\ast $ form the shared ten-cosmology evaluation set used for all full-sky and weak-lensing figures in this chapter.}}{31}{}\protected@file@percent }
