\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.4}{\ignorespaces Example patches for the transfer pipeline at native $N_{\mathrm  {side}}=2048$ (rows: shells of increasing depth, drawn from different held-out cosmologies; columns: Disco-DJ, corrected, CosmoGridV1, and the per-patch 2D power ratio). Phases are preserved, so corrected and low show identical structures; only the small-scale amplitude changes.}}{34}{}\protected@file@percent }
