\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.14}{\ignorespaces Training and validation loss of the EDM diffusion model (Eq.~\ref {eq:edm_loss}; 9-epoch rolling mean). The loss plateaus early and train/validation coincide throughout -- the per-example noise draws act as strong implicit augmentation.}}{40}{}\protected@file@percent }
